# SuperNS Configuration File
# Rename this file to .superns and add your API key

# For DeepSeek (recommended - free tier available)
# Get your key at: https://platform.deepseek.com/
SuperNS-API=sk-your-deepseek-key-here

# OR for OpenRouter (alternative)
# Get your key at: https://openrouter.ai/
# SuperNS-API=sk-or-your-openrouter-key-here

# Note: Only one API key is needed
# Change API_PROVIDER in app.py (line 36) to switch providers
